{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Divide the cost of advertising by the number of prints, and then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 divided by 1,000 prints gives CPM of $10. The currency is the currency used for the cost.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cpm-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ja","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ja","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"広告費を印刷回数で割り、次に ZXQPH0000QXZ で乗算します。例えば、$ZXQPH0001QXZ を ZXQPH0002QXZ 印刷回数で割ると CPM は $ZXQPH0003QXZ になります。通貨は、費用に使用した通貨です。","record_id":"775dad838c9588b364db8bfce7801df1f357d1c9f0d0e99131024d0a99854657","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.1111825595000013,"source":"Divide the ad spend by the number of impressions, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 over 1,000 impressions gives a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you used for spend.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"c14434161a5361c1ae7b3ae1ac78be90ef1a6cb394b485d83f55558fad116f25","status":"machine-draft","translation":"広告費を印刷回数で割り、次に 1,000 で乗算します。例えば、$10 を 1,000 印刷回数で割ると CPM は $10 になります。通貨は、費用に使用した通貨です。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
